> I am a total noob (never got further than VoD), now playing a gnomish healer.  I never got this far > with this character, so I would like to ask for any advices you can give me.  This is my current > situation:

> 1. I managed to get to the town without advancing and got my naked AC to 6.  My current AC is > -6 (no interesting armour parts beside CPM which allows me to cast spells and an elvish cloak; I > have some unIDed helmet, but it's most probably just an ordinary one)

AC -6 is decent, but you should lower it more.  Now that you're at the
temple, you should gather up every piece of armor you find and try on
the non-cursed ones.  Every point of AC counts.


>2. Got 4 pets: a dog, a housecat, a warsorse, a chameleon.

Use them to rob the stores of all their money.  This should be worth
another point of AC or 2 (or more if you're still at a low level).

